2355, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "call_01a13bb23ed77d61a4fed2e0", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 403903, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug and opened a pull request.\n\n**What I did:**\n1. Identified the issue: `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but `tests/test_money.py` (and FIN-212) require banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`).\n2. Created a new branch `fix-bankers-rounding` and updated `round_money` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n3. Triggered CI, which passed.\n4. Opened PR #101 against `main`, requesting review from `alex`.\n\nThe PR is ready for review at https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "Let me start by exploring the repository to understand the current state of the code.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a13bb21f9f71f288411b66", "function": {"arguments": "{}", "name": "list_files"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a13bb21f9f71f288411b7a", "function": {"arguments": "{\"path\":\"src/money.py\"}", "name": "read_file"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a13bb21f9f71f288411b85", "function": {"arguments": "{\"path\":\"tests/test_money.py\"}", "name": "read_file"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "The issue is clear: src/money.py uses ROUND_HALF_UP but should use ROUND_HALF_EVEN. Let me fix it.\n\nLet me create a branch and commit the fix.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a13bb2230e73e0979316d9", "function": {"arguments": "{\"branch\":\"fix-bankers-rounding\"}", "name": "create_branch"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reaso